zfstool (0.2.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Breadcrumbs plus Back (previous view); SSD/HDD media type on disks.
  * GParted-style clickable disk/partition maps and dataset/snapshot usage bars.
  * Volumes page for non-ZFS mounts (/, /boot, and other filesystems).
  * Resizable table columns; filters support comma OR, !exclude, and persist.

